[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8822.79, "timestamp": "02:27:02", "text": "我一会儿坐在椅子上，一会儿又坐下，把我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8831.07, "timestamp": "02:27:11", "text": "是的。所以，如果我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8833.389, "timestamp": "02:27:13", "text": "兴奋的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8836.55, "timestamp": "02:27:16", "text": "所以，合作并未就此结束。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8838.389, "timestamp": "02:27:18", "text": "说话的口气好像合作已经结束了似的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8840.95, "timestamp": "02:27:20", "text": "但还有更多路要走。太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8843.79, "timestamp": "02:27:23", "text": "留下来的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8845.469, "timestamp": "02:27:25", "text": "待办的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8848.95, "timestamp": "02:27:28", "text": "是的。是的，我会尽力去争取。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8850.63, "timestamp": "02:27:30", "text": "所有人都进来，然后结束。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8851.95, "timestamp": "02:27:31", "text": "每个人的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8856.23, "timestamp": "02:27:36", "text": "东西。是的，就是这样。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8858.389, "timestamp": "02:27:38", "text": "这里也在招募新人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8859.389, "timestamp": "02:27:39", "text": "那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8862.95, "timestamp": "02:27:42", "text": "是啊，希望一切顺利。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8866.389, "timestamp": "02:27:46", "text": "感谢所有光临的朋友们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8869.99, "timestamp": "02:27:49", "text": "夜溪，还有呃，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8871.91, "timestamp": "02:27:51", "text": "清晨，傍晚的小溪，我们在那里……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8876.309, "timestamp": "02:27:56", "text": "与喀山合作。她可是个元老级人物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8878.429, "timestamp": "02:27:58", "text": "我是说原版。"}]